The active implementation stream is diagnostic correctness and false-positive reduction. Do not start Mago comparisons, isolated-host reruns, allocation/GC batches, duplicate-walk audits, or editor-latency stretch work unless the user explicitly asks.

Fix false positives with failing and clean differential controls. Do not add production file walks to silence a diagnostic. Do not copy private corpus source into the repo.

